UsmRegistry::getUsmList(UsmType)
├── given registry has USMs of multiple types
│   ├── when usmType is STANDARD
│   │   └── it should return only STANDARD USMs
│   ├── when usmType is ADVANCED_PERMISSIONS
│   │   └── it should return only ADVANCED_PERMISSIONS USMs
│   └── when no registered USM matches usmType
│       └── it should return an empty array
